data: {"id": "c930f9afa05f46eb-final", "run_id": "c930f9afa05f46eb", "seq": 1350, "ts_ms": 1788811359424, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` | NotReady | 应用依赖项不可用导致就绪探针持续返回 HTTP 503，使容器被标记为未就绪（ContainersNotReady）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubelet` | `Warning Unhealthy 90s (x1350 over 66m) ... Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` ([fact-1b58c10773df](fact-1b58c10773df)) | 确认应用层面的 `ReadinessProbe` 连续 66 分钟返回 503，导致探针持续失败。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `Pod Condition` | `ContainersReady: False, Ready: False, reason: ContainersNotReady` ([fact-72b813d10923](fact-72b813d10923)) | 证实 Pod 因容器就绪状态不满足而被 K8s 标记为未就绪。 |\n| 3 | Logging | `elasticsearch` | 错误日志模式 `dependency unavailable`，HTTP `status: 503`，路径 `/work`，11 次发生，时间范围 `19:54:22 - 19:58:15` ([fact-27671913ed85](fact-27671913ed85)) | 定位应用代码在 `/work` 接口返回 503 的具体业务原因为“依赖项不可用”。 |\n| 4 | Tracing | `tempo + deepflow` | HTTP `GET /work` 返回 503，`src_ip: 172.16.104.55`, `dst_ip: 172.16.104.35`，11 次发生 ([fact-3a388dd41dc4](fact-3a388dd41dc4)) | 关联探针来源 IP 与业务端点，证明是外部探针请求触发了此 503 错误。 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_container_status_ready: 0` ([fact-df9c913c00d6](fact-df9c913c00d6)) | 外部指标确认容器就绪状态持续为 0，与 Pod Condition 状态一致。 |\n| 6 | Metric | `prometheus` | `container_memory_working_set_bytes: 15429632` (约 14.7 MiB) ([fact-719194f2b2c3](fact-719194f2b2c3)) | 内存使用量远低于配置上限 96Mi ([fact-95193e9e30d1](fact-95193e9e30d1))，排除了资源耗尽导致应用崩溃的可能。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 事件与指标一致确认了 Pod 因 `ContainersNotReady` 而处于非就绪状态；应用日志揭示了业务端点 `/work` 返回 503 的确切原因为“依赖项不可用”；追踪数据证实了这是针对该 Pod 探针端点的请求结果；资源指标排除了 OOM 等基础设施问题，所有证据均指向应用自身或其依赖关系。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用依赖项不可用 → /work 接口返回 HTTP 503 → ReadinessProbe 持续检查失败 → Pod 被标记为 ContainersNotReady (Ready: False)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**应用依赖项不可用**。\n\n应用部署的 `workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l` 在 `ReadinessProbe` 探测路径 `/work` 上持续返回 HTTP 503。根据日志证据 ([fact-27671913ed85](fact-27671913ed85))，该接口 503 状态的具体业务语义为“依赖项不可用”。由于探针持续失败，Kubernetes 无法将 Pod 标记为 `Ready`（见 [fact-72b813d10923](fact-72b813d10923) 与 [fact-df9c913c00d6](fact-df9c913c00d6)）。资源监控显示内存与 CPU 使用正常，排除了资源超限导致的进程异常，确认为应用逻辑/依赖故障。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 4.9m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 256.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l: 256.9s (Evidence 250.9s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-7b77l**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 292.953, "metrics": {"run_id": "c930f9afa05f46eb", "mttr": {"value": "4.9m", "seconds": 292.9603850841522, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 292960.3850841522, "llm_calls": 19, "llm_duration_ms": 139432.0044517517, "tool_calls": 50, "executed_tool_calls": 38, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 12, "successful_tool_calls": 46, "failed_tool_calls": 4, "tool_duration_ms": 376942.54875183105, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 141850.48508644104}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20286.598205566406, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 256928.97486686707, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 15724.956274032593, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

